{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066066/block/singleImage/3279910/df/01M8DG00MQJJG6GR00H5Y4WFDP.png?updatedAt=1795749368\"/><figcaption>上環往蛇口客輪「新迅隆貳號」撞到青衣路友聯船廠對開船塢，多人受傷(無線新聞畫面)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（27日）早上9時25分，警方接報，青衣路對開海域有船隻意外。據報，一艘上環往蛇口客輪「新迅隆貳號」撞到青衣路友聯船廠對開船塢，至少25人受傷，其中5人嚴重，全部清醒，分別送往瑪嘉烈醫院及仁濟醫院治理， 有傷者要用頸箍協助 。消防出動消防船及流動傷者治療車，大批救護車在場戒備， 涉事客輪被拖到友聯船廠 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.107911+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:28:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:57:15.421049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:14.586625+00:00","content_hash":"f27c328d22dd25f905445695ff08212340238da8e0126d0c01e9501ea2881e5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:43:58.107911+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}